    skos:note "BatteryPass-Ready v1.3 longlist attribute #72. Performance & durability passport property per Annex XIII; required by the GEFEG BatteryPass-Ready live validator across all four categories (MaximumPermittedBatteryPower, watt_celsius_integer_onevalue). Distinct from eubat:hasRatedMaximumPower (rated output). No equivalent GS1 term exists."@en;
    skos:exactMatch <urn:samm:io.BatteryPass.Performance:1.2.1#ratedMaximumPower>, <https://repository.product-passport.ec.europa.eu/product/batteries/vocabs/battery-vocabulary#powerLimit>, <https://dpp-keystone.org/spec/v3/terms#powerMaximumPermitted>, <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-performance#maximumPermittedBatteryPower>, <https://ref.openepcis.org/vocab/batterypass-ready/2.0.1#maximumPermittedBatteryPower>;
